      "source": "Instead of clicking on a note which switches the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Note Tree__TRILIUM_PH_1__ to the newly selected note, or navigating between two different __TRILIUM_PH_2__Tabs__TRILIUM_PH_3__, the __TRILIUM_PH_4__Quick edit__TRILIUM_PH_5__ feature opens as a popup window that can be easily dismissed.",
